(3992258, 570366, 68546, '<td valign="top">Wow! I bet you get a good few comments against your processing but I think it works really well in this shot. I don''t like the trees in the background with the dark blue halo''s but the slightly desaturated girls in the cafe look excellent, and the chairs and people walking by that look like a painting outside give the shot a nice edge. I get this is a Lucis Filter (not sure how that''s spelt!) but I look forward to seeing the processing for this after voting is done, and I hope you do well with this one</td>', 'Wow! I bet you get a good few comments against your processing but I think it works really well in this shot. I don''t like the trees in the background with the dark blue halo''s but the slightly desaturated girls in the cafe look excellent, and the chairs and people walking by that look like a painting outside give the shot a nice edge. I get this is a Lucis Filter (not sure how that''s spelt!) but I look forward to seeing the processing for this after voting is done, and I hope you do well with this one', '2007-08-13 03:36:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3992273, 569650, 66201, '<td valign="top">Just love the DOF and poetry of this.</td>', 'Just love the DOF and poetry of this.', '2007-08-13 03:41:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3992275, 569736, 66201, '<td valign="top">Striking image - could be a book cover.</td>', 'Striking image - could be a book cover.', '2007-08-13 03:42:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3992277, 570335, 54632, '<td valign="top">fantastic!</td>', 'fantastic!', '2007-08-13 03:43:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3992281, 569420, 66201, '<td valign="top">Great macro shot.</td>', 'Great macro shot.', '2007-08-13 03:44:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(3992282, 570527, 66201, '<td valign="top">Simple and Zen-like. Hope you get a decent score</td>', 'Simple and Zen-like. Hope you get a decent score', '2007-08-13 03:45:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3992286, 570194, 66201, '<td valign="top">lacks "oomf" - not sure if it needs greater contrast or perhaps a more contrasty background so tha the face stands out....</td>', 'lacks "oomf" - not sure if it needs greater contrast or perhaps a more contrasty background so tha the face stands out....', '2007-08-13 03:46:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3992333, 569814, 57775, '<td valign="top">OMG I love this... what a story this tells.  10.</td>', 'OMG I love this... what a story this tells.  10.', '2007-08-13 04:06:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3992337, 570063, 57775, '<td valign="top">I''m realizing Ostriches and Emus make such great subjects - I''ve never seen one I don''t like.  This is exceptional, though - the pure black background really ads to your composition as all the attention goes to the ostrich''s face, and especially his eye, which is perfectly crisp and in focus.  Great shot!</td>', 'I''m realizing Ostriches and Emus make such great subjects - I''ve never seen one I don''t like.  This is exceptional, though - the pure black background really ads to your composition as all the attention goes to the ostrich''s face, and especially his eye, which is perfectly crisp and in focus.  Great shot!', '2007-08-13 04:09:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3992340, 570072, 57775, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous shot!  Can you PM me and let me know where you took this?  I''m visiting SF this week and am looking for good spots to shoot the Golden Gate.  Thanks!</td>', 'Gorgeous shot!  Can you PM me and let me know where you took this?  I''m visiting SF this week and am looking for good spots to shoot the Golden Gate.  Thanks!', '2007-08-13 04:12:42.000000', NULL, 1);
