(3992382, 570601, 8860, '<td valign="top">Very handsome and regal. A lovely, healthy specimen indeed (I have one too, had ''im for around 16 years, called Dylan). I would have pulled off that shed skin before the shot mind (how could you resist??!!).<br/>: )</td>', 'Very handsome and regal. A lovely, healthy specimen indeed (I have one too, had ''im for around 16 years, called Dylan). I would have pulled off that shed skin before the shot mind (how could you resist??!!).: )', '2007-08-13 04:59:32.000000', NULL, 1),
