(3992441, 570537, 77543, '<td valign="top">I would have removed the background in the upper right of the frame. It distracts from an otherwise good portrait.</td>', 'I would have removed the background in the upper right of the frame. It distracts from an otherwise good portrait.', '2007-08-13 05:45:15.000000', NULL, 1),
