(3992455, 569867, 77543, '<td valign="top">The composition is ok. The lighting on the face is nice. The flowers are a little dark but could be lightened in post processing. The only disappointment is the cluttered background.</td>', 'The composition is ok. The lighting on the face is nice. The flowers are a little dark but could be lightened in post processing. The only disappointment is the cluttered background.', '2007-08-13 05:51:41.000000', NULL, 1),
