(3992500, 569825, 66616, '<td valign="top">too light.</td>', 'too light.', '2007-08-13 06:07:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3992501, 570158, 77543, '<td valign="top">You''ve got nice great colour in the centre cloud. The upper right is totally blown out though and spoils the effect. If the original picture had no detail in that area I would have cropped the top third away. You''d have been left with a much stronger picture.</td>', 'You''ve got nice great colour in the centre cloud. The upper right is totally blown out though and spoils the effect. If the original picture had no detail in that area I would have cropped the top third away. You''d have been left with a much stronger picture.', '2007-08-13 06:08:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3992508, 570666, 73452, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, and very surreal, almost like it was a painting.  I''d love to see prints of this done.  Great job.</td>', 'Beautiful, and very surreal, almost like it was a painting.  I''d love to see prints of this done.  Great job.', '2007-08-13 06:12:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3992509, 569898, 53316, '<td valign="top">I think I would have liked this better cropped just below the hair, because the bottom half, notably the color of the nails, distracts me from your lovely face.  And yes, your face does indeed look quite nice here :-)</td>', 'I think I would have liked this better cropped just below the hair, because the bottom half, notably the color of the nails, distracts me from your lovely face.  And yes, your face does indeed look quite nice here :-)', '2007-08-13 06:12:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3992511, 569428, 77543, '<td valign="top">Very nice. I especially like the people and trees fade into the background. My first thought is that the sun is too large and bright in the frame and would a crop containing just the people and trees on the right work? But no, what you have is compositionally much better.</td>', 'Very nice. I especially like the people and trees fade into the background. My first thought is that the sun is too large and bright in the frame and would a crop containing just the people and trees on the right work? But no, what you have is compositionally much better.', '2007-08-13 06:13:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3992516, 570394, 53316, '<td valign="top">OH MY GOSH YES.  Awesome.</td>', 'OH MY GOSH YES.  Awesome.', '2007-08-13 06:17:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3992518, 570438, 53316, '<td valign="top">Perfect.</td>', 'Perfect.', '2007-08-13 06:18:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3992520, 570624, 73452, '<td valign="top">Oh man this guy is very good looking!  And I love the song that the title is reffering to!  "hey there delilah whats it like in new york city your a thousand miles away but girl tonight you look so pretty yes you do, times square cant shine as bright at you, you know its true..."  yes, i love it.  And love this picture..</td>', 'Oh man this guy is very good looking!  And I love the song that the title is reffering to!  "hey there delilah whats it like in new york city your a thousand miles away but girl tonight you look so pretty yes you do, times square cant shine as bright at you, you know its true..."  yes, i love it.  And love this picture..', '2007-08-13 06:18:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3992522, 570348, 53316, '<td valign="top">Neat. I like this because it''s a picture of Stonehenge that isn''t OH MY GOSH STONEHENGE LOOK AT IT but it''s just like, hey this is something cool in an awesome environment.  Really great photo, maybe the only critique would be the bit of banding I''m seeing in the sky.</td>', 'Neat. I like this because it''s a picture of Stonehenge that isn''t OH MY GOSH STONEHENGE LOOK AT IT but it''s just like, hey this is something cool in an awesome environment.  Really great photo, maybe the only critique would be the bit of banding I''m seeing in the sky.', '2007-08-13 06:19:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3992534, 570051, 73452, '<td valign="top">I have tried so many times to do these sorts of shots, but have never EVER come to the beauty that this portrays!  Did you get it all over your lens as i did, i hope im not the only one!  Great macro and capture!</td>', 'I have tried so many times to do these sorts of shots, but have never EVER come to the beauty that this portrays!  Did you get it all over your lens as i did, i hope im not the only one!  Great macro and capture!', '2007-08-13 06:26:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(3992539, 570618, 77543, '<td valign="top">I don''t think the crop should have been halfway through the mouth - above or below.</td>', 'I don''t think the crop should have been halfway through the mouth - above or below.', '2007-08-13 06:29:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3992543, 569444, 77543, '<td valign="top">In all the processing you didn''t straighten the horizon.</td>', 'In all the processing you didn''t straighten the horizon.', '2007-08-13 06:31:36.000000', NULL, 1),
