(3993512, 570326, 70000, '<td valign="top">hmmm, what a strange combination of elements. the title makes me wonder what she is devoted to, because she seems like she is dressed for a desk job at a lawfirm and yet she is leaning up against a tattered old wall and touching it like it is something precious to her but looking in the camera with a look that says to me, why dont you help me? i need you. This is really intriguing i am going to have to come back to it,</td>', 'hmmm, what a strange combination of elements. the title makes me wonder what she is devoted to, because she seems like she is dressed for a desk job at a lawfirm and yet she is leaning up against a tattered old wall and touching it like it is something precious to her but looking in the camera with a look that says to me, why dont you help me? i need you. This is really intriguing i am going to have to come back to it,', '2007-08-13 12:15:55.000000', NULL, 1),
