(3993641, 570520, 24454, '<td valign="top">Awwwwwwwwwww   Talk about the bride being overshadowed by a lady even more eyecatching and beautiful than she is :)   Not to take anything away from her, its just that the baby!!!!  Almost caused a cute overdose :)</td>', 'Awwwwwwwwwww   Talk about the bride being overshadowed by a lady even more eyecatching and beautiful than she is :)   Not to take anything away from her, its just that the baby!!!!  Almost caused a cute overdose :)', '2007-08-13 12:44:30.000000', NULL, 1),
