(3995896, 570379, 80096, '<td valign="top">It''s too busy. The sky would be nice alone and the pineapple field would be nice alone, but together it''s a bit much.</td>', 'It''s too busy. The sky would be nice alone and the pineapple field would be nice alone, but together it''s a bit much.', '2007-08-14 01:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3995900, 569376, 80096, '<td valign="top">I think this is a nice study and it definitely evokes an emotion.</td>', 'I think this is a nice study and it definitely evokes an emotion.', '2007-08-14 01:40:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3995913, 570286, 80096, '<td valign="top">The effect is a little strange and the focus is off. I realize you were trying for a fire effect but if not for the title, it would be rather vague.</td>', 'The effect is a little strange and the focus is off. I realize you were trying for a fire effect but if not for the title, it would be rather vague.', '2007-08-14 01:44:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3995915, 570207, 80096, '<td valign="top">Nice attempt. Perhaps less haze and more mountain would have worked better. It seems to be lacking a focal point.</td>', 'Nice attempt. Perhaps less haze and more mountain would have worked better. It seems to be lacking a focal point.', '2007-08-14 01:46:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3995917, 570014, 80096, '<td valign="top">They don''t really look like eggs and the sharpening is overdone.</td>', 'They don''t really look like eggs and the sharpening is overdone.', '2007-08-14 01:48:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3995919, 570270, 80096, '<td valign="top">Scarey dude.</td>', 'Scarey dude.', '2007-08-14 01:49:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3995922, 570444, 80096, '<td valign="top">The only thing that bothers me is the foreground is too dark. Otherwise it''s nicely done.</td>', 'The only thing that bothers me is the foreground is too dark. Otherwise it''s nicely done.', '2007-08-14 01:51:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3995926, 569413, 80096, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait. The sharpening is a tad overdone...he would have looked better if left more natural. Otherwise well done.</td>', 'Nice portrait. The sharpening is a tad overdone...he would have looked better if left more natural. Otherwise well done.', '2007-08-14 01:53:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3995930, 569256, 80096, '<td valign="top">I think this little fellow''s face gets lost in the shadows. I want to see the expression on his face because that''s the focal point of the portrait.</td>', 'I think this little fellow''s face gets lost in the shadows. I want to see the expression on his face because that''s the focal point of the portrait.', '2007-08-14 01:55:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3995933, 569990, 80096, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what this is.</td>', 'I''m not sure what this is.', '2007-08-14 01:56:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3995938, 569867, 80096, '<td valign="top">Darks and lights appear to be clashing. This would have looked much better with a softer tonage.</td>', 'Darks and lights appear to be clashing. This would have looked much better with a softer tonage.', '2007-08-14 01:58:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3995942, 569752, 80096, '<td valign="top">Focus is off and the angle bothers me. It''s unnatural.</td>', 'Focus is off and the angle bothers me. It''s unnatural.', '2007-08-14 01:59:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3995946, 569917, 80096, '<td valign="top">I like this, it has a very nice feel to it. The softness in the bee is exceptional.</td>', 'I like this, it has a very nice feel to it. The softness in the bee is exceptional.', '2007-08-14 02:01:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3995947, 570110, 69464, '<td valign="top">No focal point.</td>', 'No focal point.', '2007-08-14 02:01:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(3995948, 570128, 80096, '<td valign="top">Nice detail, good perspective. I like the sky effect, it adds to the image without overpowering it.</td>', 'Nice detail, good perspective. I like the sky effect, it adds to the image without overpowering it.', '2007-08-14 02:02:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3995952, 570225, 80096, '<td valign="top">Aren''t sunflowers fun? ;-)</td>', 'Aren''t sunflowers fun? ;-)', '2007-08-14 02:03:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3995967, 569730, 80096, '<td valign="top">Another balloon fest. These always make great photos. I like the way you handled this, the second balloon is the focal point. I also like your midnight blue sky, very dramatic against the hot-air balloons. You even maintained an uneven number of balloons, good Feng Shui.</td>', 'Another balloon fest. These always make great photos. I like the way you handled this, the second balloon is the focal point. I also like your midnight blue sky, very dramatic against the hot-air balloons. You even maintained an uneven number of balloons, good Feng Shui.', '2007-08-14 02:08:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3995971, 570094, 80096, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately it''s out of focus.</td>', 'Unfortunately it''s out of focus.', '2007-08-14 02:09:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3995979, 570602, 80096, '<td valign="top">That''s a great scene. Where is this, Appalachia? I like the contrast of the bright colored clothes against the stark colors of the dilapidated barn and trees. It works.</td>', 'That''s a great scene. Where is this, Appalachia? I like the contrast of the bright colored clothes against the stark colors of the dilapidated barn and trees. It works.', '2007-08-14 02:13:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3995981, 569521, 80096, '<td valign="top">I''m not even going to try to guess what this is. But, it''s very colorful. Probably bubbles in a glass of Perrier. I don''t know why but I like it.</td>', 'I''m not even going to try to guess what this is. But, it''s very colorful. Probably bubbles in a glass of Perrier. I don''t know why but I like it.', '2007-08-14 02:16:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3995984, 570579, 80096, '<td valign="top">Dear me... LOL</td>', 'Dear me... LOL', '2007-08-14 02:17:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3995986, 570677, 80096, '<td valign="top">Almost surreal looking. A little too much gray. More lights to contrast the darks would have helped.</td>', 'Almost surreal looking. A little too much gray. More lights to contrast the darks would have helped.', '2007-08-14 02:19:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3995988, 570119, 74979, '<td valign="top">mine was a ''79, royal blue; bought her right after I graduated college &amp; had moved to LA..gosh I loved that car! great for cruising the highways of California!! <br/> <br/>thanks for the memory~ goodluck!</td>', 'mine was a ''79, royal blue; bought her right after I graduated college & had moved to LA..gosh I loved that car! great for cruising the highways of California!!  thanks for the memory~ goodluck!', '2007-08-14 02:19:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3995991, 570594, 74979, '<td valign="top">crystal clear, great colors, nice comp</td>', 'crystal clear, great colors, nice comp', '2007-08-14 02:20:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3995994, 570364, 80096, '<td valign="top">Had you shown a hand holding the bread it would have been more believable. The focus could have been better.</td>', 'Had you shown a hand holding the bread it would have been more believable. The focus could have been better.', '2007-08-14 02:22:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(3995999, 570269, 80096, '<td valign="top">What is that? And what are those bubble shapes?</td>', 'What is that? And what are those bubble shapes?', '2007-08-14 02:34:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(3996001, 569753, 80096, '<td valign="top">You over-sharpened the poor thing, especially his head. He''s beautiful enough. Next time, leave it more natural.</td>', 'You over-sharpened the poor thing, especially his head. He''s beautiful enough. Next time, leave it more natural.', '2007-08-14 02:35:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3996002, 570380, 80096, '<td valign="top">Now that''s one grubby-looking guy. LOL</td>', 'Now that''s one grubby-looking guy. LOL', '2007-08-14 02:37:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3996004, 569285, 80096, '<td valign="top">Cute. Unfortunately, the background vies with the owl. Better color/contrast would have helped.</td>', 'Cute. Unfortunately, the background vies with the owl. Better color/contrast would have helped.', '2007-08-14 02:38:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3996008, 570470, 80096, '<td valign="top">I like the texture of the cat''s fur, it''s very natural looking. The eye reflecting the light. And the muted colors in the floor You did a very good job.</td>', 'I like the texture of the cat''s fur, it''s very natural looking. The eye reflecting the light. And the muted colors in the floor You did a very good job.', '2007-08-14 02:41:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3996011, 569735, 80096, '<td valign="top">Ok, I give up. A garden rake? It''s a strange perspective but somehow it kind of works.</td>', 'Ok, I give up. A garden rake? It''s a strange perspective but somehow it kind of works.', '2007-08-14 02:44:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3996012, 570038, 80096, '<td valign="top">Fireworks and hot air balloons always make nice photos. Lots of color and your exposure was on-the-nose.</td>', 'Fireworks and hot air balloons always make nice photos. Lots of color and your exposure was on-the-nose.', '2007-08-14 02:45:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(3996014, 570560, 80096, '<td valign="top">Interesting bokeh. It kind of works.</td>', 'Interesting bokeh. It kind of works.', '2007-08-14 02:47:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3996015, 570056, 73601, '<td valign="top">the block behind your duck is very distracting</td>', 'the block behind your duck is very distracting', '2007-08-14 02:47:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3996016, 570402, 80096, '<td valign="top">Nice try. Next time try a daytime study. ;-)</td>', 'Nice try. Next time try a daytime study. ;-)', '2007-08-14 02:48:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3996019, 570124, 69325, '<td valign="top">original and very cool</td>', 'original and very cool', '2007-08-14 02:50:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3996020, 570072, 80096, '<td valign="top">Magazine quality.</td>', 'Magazine quality.', '2007-08-14 02:50:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3996022, 569487, 53316, '<td valign="top">I love that it doesn''t look overprocessed.</td>', 'I love that it doesn''t look overprocessed.', '2007-08-14 02:51:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3996024, 569922, 75386, '<td valign="top">great photo, hope you have details on for me to read later on!</td>', 'great photo, hope you have details on for me to read later on!', '2007-08-14 02:53:19.000000', NULL, 1),
