(3998318, 570650, 63398, '<td valign="top">As one who has tried to capture lightning many times over the last three decades, you have my utmost appreciation and admiration for this truly spectacular shot.<br/> <br/>No gratuitous 10, but IMNSHO a truly well earned, and honestly given 9.<br/> <br/>Its technicals, composition, processing, and just all ''round presentation even showed in its thumbnail.<br/> <br/>I hope you do as well as I believe you should as evidenced by my vote.<br/> <br/>Also right into my favorites!</td>', 'As one who has tried to capture lightning many times over the last three decades, you have my utmost appreciation and admiration for this truly spectacular shot. No gratuitous 10, but IMNSHO a truly well earned, and honestly given 9. Its technicals, composition, processing, and just all ''round presentation even showed in its thumbnail. I hope you do as well as I believe you should as evidenced by my vote. Also right into my favorites!', '2007-08-14 22:26:25.000000', NULL, 1),
