(3999504, 570051, 36065, '<td valign="top">Yep.  Another image of a droplet.  Technically strong, but an extreme lack of creativity.<br/> <br/>ETA: Sorry for the jackass comment a few months back.  It really is a great shot, and you have proven me well wrong in even entertaining the thought that maybe this was the only shots you would perfect.  Unbelievable and amazing work Irene!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-07-07 09:40:47.</i></td>', 'Yep.  Another image of a droplet.  Technically strong, but an extreme lack of creativity. ETA: Sorry for the jackass comment a few months back.  It really is a great shot, and you have proven me well wrong in even entertaining the thought that maybe this was the only shots you would perfect.  Unbelievable and amazing work Irene!', '2007-08-15 04:45:03.000000', '2008-07-07 10:40:47.000000', 1),
