(3999546, 569807, 52439, '<td valign="top">Lovely subtle tones make it feel light and feathery. Very good focus aswell.</td>', 'Lovely subtle tones make it feel light and feathery. Very good focus aswell.', '2007-08-15 05:34:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3999551, 569715, 52439, '<td valign="top">Not a bad shot, two things i think might improve it to me are to increase the contrast and lighten it a little, seems a bit dull and grey, and also to have a wider crop, and include more of what she is staring at.</td>', 'Not a bad shot, two things i think might improve it to me are to increase the contrast and lighten it a little, seems a bit dull and grey, and also to have a wider crop, and include more of what she is staring at.', '2007-08-15 05:35:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3999552, 569360, 52439, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot.<br/>Interesting colours in the sky and what a moon/sun/eclipse, im not sure which.</td>', 'Very cool shot.Interesting colours in the sky and what a moon/sun/eclipse, im not sure which.', '2007-08-15 05:35:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3999555, 570692, 67373, '<td valign="top">Nice clarity.</td>', 'Nice clarity.', '2007-08-15 05:38:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3999556, 569973, 52439, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot.<br/>Great example of a telephoto used for landscape.<br/>The dodging of the foreground trees to the right is quite visible though.</td>', 'Very nice shot.Great example of a telephoto used for landscape.The dodging of the foreground trees to the right is quite visible though.', '2007-08-15 05:38:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3999560, 570316, 52439, '<td valign="top">A quick ''Levels'' adjustment would boost the colours and contrast of this very well.<br/>If you have photoshop i suggest trying it;<br/>Image &gt; Adjustments &gt; Levels, then drag the sliders to where the black ''mountain'' starts and stops in the graph.<br/> <br/>I hope i''m not ''teaching you to suck eggs'' as it were, just a suggestion you might not know of.<br/>I do like the shot though, wish we had birds like that round here!</td>', 'A quick ''Levels'' adjustment would boost the colours and contrast of this very well.If you have photoshop i suggest trying it;Image > Adjustments > Levels, then drag the sliders to where the black ''mountain'' starts and stops in the graph. I hope i''m not ''teaching you to suck eggs'' as it were, just a suggestion you might not know of.I do like the shot though, wish we had birds like that round here!', '2007-08-15 05:43:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3999562, 570280, 52439, '<td valign="top">I like it.<br/>Amazing ''clarity'' (for want of a better word) on the women, she looks 3d almost.</td>', 'I like it.Amazing ''clarity'' (for want of a better word) on the women, she looks 3d almost.', '2007-08-15 05:43:45.000000', NULL, 1),
