(3999712, 569844, 27415, '<td valign="top">Great composition and color.  I love how the family/group are encircled in light - makes it a very exciting moment - almost stagelike.</td>', 'Great composition and color.  I love how the family/group are encircled in light - makes it a very exciting moment - almost stagelike.', '2007-08-15 07:25:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3999714, 570268, 27415, '<td valign="top">Although I do like the composition and color range, this would be a much stronger image if the person was not in it.  The eye is drawn immediately to the person because of the green shirt and the viewer misses the spectalcular landscape...</td>', 'Although I do like the composition and color range, this would be a much stronger image if the person was not in it.  The eye is drawn immediately to the person because of the green shirt and the viewer misses the spectalcular landscape...', '2007-08-15 07:28:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3999716, 569730, 27415, '<td valign="top">Another spectacular image!</td>', 'Another spectacular image!', '2007-08-15 07:28:38.000000', NULL, 1),
