(3999727, 570119, 27415, '<td valign="top">I paused for a minute to look at this photo to figure out how you got such a beautiful shot on an uncrowded, perfect street - all I can come up with is that this is a model house and car???<br/> <br/>Cery well composed and the depth of field works very well for this image.</td>', 'I paused for a minute to look at this photo to figure out how you got such a beautiful shot on an uncrowded, perfect street - all I can come up with is that this is a model house and car??? Cery well composed and the depth of field works very well for this image.', '2007-08-15 07:34:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3999734, 570366, 27415, '<td valign="top">Lots to see in this image.  It took me a minute to figure out what was going on.  I like the contrast of colors and the composition is great.  Well done!</td>', 'Lots to see in this image.  It took me a minute to figure out what was going on.  I like the contrast of colors and the composition is great.  Well done!', '2007-08-15 07:38:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3999741, 569814, 27415, '<td valign="top">This makes me want to quit smoking!  Good composition and well exposed.</td>', 'This makes me want to quit smoking!  Good composition and well exposed.', '2007-08-15 07:40:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3999743, 570038, 27415, '<td valign="top">I have seen many fireworks shots but this one is different because of the people profile in the forefront.  Very nicely done!</td>', 'I have seen many fireworks shots but this one is different because of the people profile in the forefront.  Very nicely done!', '2007-08-15 07:42:09.000000', NULL, 1),
