(3999761, 570468, 27415, '<td valign="top">I like this shot - the colors and composition are very good.  The object in the upper left hand corner is distracting though.  Popping a flash may have caught the detail of the middle birdhouse a little better...</td>', 'I like this shot - the colors and composition are very good.  The object in the upper left hand corner is distracting though.  Popping a flash may have caught the detail of the middle birdhouse a little better...', '2007-08-15 07:48:50.000000', NULL, 1),
