(3999782, 570581, 27415, '<td valign="top">Great action shot.  Timing for te composition is excellant!  I would pump up the saturation a little to really make the yellow bike jump right out at the viewer.</td>', 'Great action shot.  Timing for te composition is excellant!  I would pump up the saturation a little to really make the yellow bike jump right out at the viewer.', '2007-08-15 07:54:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3999791, 570603, 27415, '<td valign="top">I would like to see this image in color - I think it would be so much stronger.  The composition is good and the viewer is left wondering why the boy is not playing with the flyer - bored, time-out???</td>', 'I would like to see this image in color - I think it would be so much stronger.  The composition is good and the viewer is left wondering why the boy is not playing with the flyer - bored, time-out???', '2007-08-15 07:56:28.000000', NULL, 1),
