(4002897, 570627, 82092, '<td valign="top">Very appealing to the eye. I like the spots of light in the foreground. I think the green tones of the water really pull out the green tones of the mountains.</td>', 'Very appealing to the eye. I like the spots of light in the foreground. I think the green tones of the water really pull out the green tones of the mountains.', '2007-08-16 00:34:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4002905, 570229, 82092, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture of a place that looks so tranquil. The reflections in the water are superb.</td>', 'Beautiful capture of a place that looks so tranquil. The reflections in the water are superb.', '2007-08-16 00:37:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4002908, 569374, 66616, '<td valign="top">Beautiful bird, pity its not in sharper focus.</td>', 'Beautiful bird, pity its not in sharper focus.', '2007-08-16 00:38:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4002913, 569945, 82092, '<td valign="top">I absolutely love this picture. The colors are so vibrant and really draw me into the picture. I just want to walk up the stairs and sit in the grass and enjoy the rays of sunshine.</td>', 'I absolutely love this picture. The colors are so vibrant and really draw me into the picture. I just want to walk up the stairs and sit in the grass and enjoy the rays of sunshine.', '2007-08-16 00:39:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4002915, 569847, 66616, '<td valign="top">The subject is too far to the right for my liking but very sharp and nice colours.</td>', 'The subject is too far to the right for my liking but very sharp and nice colours.', '2007-08-16 00:40:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4002923, 569902, 66616, '<td valign="top">Too much Empty space!</td>', 'Too much Empty space!', '2007-08-16 00:41:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4002932, 569376, 15711, '<td valign="top">Terrific focus on the eye.  Leaving the metal post there gives us a sense of his whereabouts. I like it.</td>', 'Terrific focus on the eye.  Leaving the metal post there gives us a sense of his whereabouts. I like it.', '2007-08-16 00:44:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4002937, 569872, 15711, '<td valign="top">I love the colors of the sky.</td>', 'I love the colors of the sky.', '2007-08-16 00:45:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4002939, 569420, 15711, '<td valign="top">The intricacy is incredible.  Every little inch - all well detailed.</td>', 'The intricacy is incredible.  Every little inch - all well detailed.', '2007-08-16 00:46:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4002943, 570169, 15711, '<td valign="top">That''s really good. Great sense of his harsh working environment with the bright light.  Nicely done.</td>', 'That''s really good. Great sense of his harsh working environment with the bright light.  Nicely done.', '2007-08-16 00:46:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4002946, 570348, 15711, '<td valign="top">Stunning composition with the cloud right over the famous stones. Great perspective.</td>', 'Stunning composition with the cloud right over the famous stones. Great perspective.', '2007-08-16 00:47:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4002948, 570536, 82092, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity of this picture. The colors really caught my attention. One minor thing that was distracting to me was the small dark spot on, what I believe to be, the bottom of the glass that is lying down.</td>', 'I like the simplicity of this picture. The colors really caught my attention. One minor thing that was distracting to me was the small dark spot on, what I believe to be, the bottom of the glass that is lying down.', '2007-08-16 00:47:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4002961, 570283, 82092, '<td valign="top">The lighting really adds to the mood of this picture. I like how the color of the gentleman''s suit is similar to the rocks surrounding him.</td>', 'The lighting really adds to the mood of this picture. I like how the color of the gentleman''s suit is similar to the rocks surrounding him.', '2007-08-16 00:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4002969, 570650, 15711, '<td valign="top">WOAH  Perfect timing.  Love the rich blue/black sky.  Nicely done. 8</td>', 'WOAH  Perfect timing.  Love the rich blue/black sky.  Nicely done. 8', '2007-08-16 00:52:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4002975, 570023, 15711, '<td valign="top">hee hee - looks like she has on false eyelashes. GREAT macro - DOF.</td>', 'hee hee - looks like she has on false eyelashes. GREAT macro - DOF.', '2007-08-16 00:53:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4002991, 569912, 82092, '<td valign="top">The vibrant colors of the background really make these boats pop against the more pale colors of the land and water. Stunning!</td>', 'The vibrant colors of the background really make these boats pop against the more pale colors of the land and water. Stunning!', '2007-08-16 00:55:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4002994, 570137, 15711, '<td valign="top">woah.  That is really cool. Love the detail.</td>', 'woah.  That is really cool. Love the detail.', '2007-08-16 00:56:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4002999, 570650, 82092, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of a lightening bolt. Then to top it off the reflection on the water just raises this picture one bar higher.</td>', 'Nice capture of a lightening bolt. Then to top it off the reflection on the water just raises this picture one bar higher.', '2007-08-16 00:58:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4003001, 570107, 15711, '<td valign="top">Love the movement.  Nice duplication of diagonal line too. ;~D</td>', 'Love the movement.  Nice duplication of diagonal line too. ;~D', '2007-08-16 00:58:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4003009, 569814, 48228, '<td valign="top">Truely <b>EXCELLENT</b> portrait here, and this is one very fine <b>CAPTURE</b> IMO.....  <br/> <br/>This so looks like a Manny <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=14386" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Librodo</a> re the model/person, <b>but</b> I don''t think it is, the same model, come to think of it......<br/> <br/>Totally amazing, and so worth to be in the <b>TOP</b> three for a ribbon.....<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-08-20 01:29:38.</i></td>', 'Truely EXCELLENT portrait here, and this is one very fine CAPTURE IMO.....   This so looks like a Manny  Librodo re the model/person, but I don''t think it is, the same model, come to think of it...... Totally amazing, and so worth to be in the TOP three for a ribbon.....', '2007-08-16 01:00:41.000000', '2007-08-20 02:29:38.000000', 1),
