(4003014, 569479, 82092, '<td valign="top">I can almost hear the rushing of the water. I like how the water seems to be rushing towards me. The water does seem a bit too smooth though. Overall, a great capture.</td>', 'I can almost hear the rushing of the water. I like how the water seems to be rushing towards me. The water does seem a bit too smooth though. Overall, a great capture.', '2007-08-16 01:02:11.000000', NULL, 1),
