(4003057, 570452, 82092, '<td valign="top">The subtle lighting in the background really pulls the viewer into the picture. I like the contrast of the smooth water with the jaggedness of the rocks.</td>', 'The subtle lighting in the background really pulls the viewer into the picture. I like the contrast of the smooth water with the jaggedness of the rocks.', '2007-08-16 01:15:56.000000', NULL, 1),
