(4003622, 569376, 75555, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, you really captured the emotion in his face. The POV is a little different, which adds to it (IMO), and you did a great job getting the detail, It would have been nice if his ear was as sharp as the rest of his face, but that''s a minor point.</td>', 'Beautiful shot, you really captured the emotion in his face. The POV is a little different, which adds to it (IMO), and you did a great job getting the detail, It would have been nice if his ear was as sharp as the rest of his face, but that''s a minor point.', '2007-08-16 08:56:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4003626, 570259, 75555, '<td valign="top">Neat concept, but your lines could be a lot smoother with not a lot of effort. (between the black and white in the middle)</td>', 'Neat concept, but your lines could be a lot smoother with not a lot of effort. (between the black and white in the middle)', '2007-08-16 08:59:14.000000', NULL, 1),
