(4004807, 570626, 67152, '<td valign="top">I really like the tones and shade of green here, but the thing I like most of all is how the highlighted area in the background creates an almost ethereal glow around the main subject<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-08-21 07:59:28.</i></td>', 'I really like the tones and shade of green here, but the thing I like most of all is how the highlighted area in the background creates an almost ethereal glow around the main subject', '2007-08-16 17:09:54.000000', '2007-08-21 08:59:28.000000', 1),
