(4005692, 570649, 13207, '<td valign="top">Really neat image - what on earth kind of plant is that?  <br/> <br/>I think this shot may have worked better if you could have taken it from an angle that would have left a completely clear background, I find the trees on the left to be distracting.</td>', 'Really neat image - what on earth kind of plant is that?   I think this shot may have worked better if you could have taken it from an angle that would have left a completely clear background, I find the trees on the left to be distracting.', '2007-08-17 00:04:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4005696, 570366, 13207, '<td valign="top">Great shot - excellent job in the post processing.</td>', 'Great shot - excellent job in the post processing.', '2007-08-17 00:06:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4005699, 569796, 41337, '<td valign="top">Very nice textures. The tonemapping isn''t too noticable but the sharpening is a hair too much, IMO.</td>', 'Very nice textures. The tonemapping isn''t too noticable but the sharpening is a hair too much, IMO.', '2007-08-17 00:07:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4005703, 569432, 41337, '<td valign="top">Fascinating model. The b/w, lighting and composition all perfect.</td>', 'Fascinating model. The b/w, lighting and composition all perfect.', '2007-08-17 00:09:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4005708, 569403, 41337, '<td valign="top">Cool shot. The dizziness works very well.</td>', 'Cool shot. The dizziness works very well.', '2007-08-17 00:10:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4005820, 569970, 82092, '<td valign="top">Creepy picture in a good way. The bright light at the top of the door is distracting and pulls the eye away from the hand.</td>', 'Creepy picture in a good way. The bright light at the top of the door is distracting and pulls the eye away from the hand.', '2007-08-17 01:11:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4005822, 569944, 82092, '<td valign="top">I am not sure if the movement of the camera was intentional for this picture. IMHO I think it takes away from the picture. The colors and what I believe to be reflection could have been very nice without the distortion.</td>', 'I am not sure if the movement of the camera was intentional for this picture. IMHO I think it takes away from the picture. The colors and what I believe to be reflection could have been very nice without the distortion.', '2007-08-17 01:13:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4005826, 570028, 82092, '<td valign="top">I like the various colors in this picture. Maybe if you had positioned the girls in an area away from the grate it may have had a little more oomph overall.</td>', 'I like the various colors in this picture. Maybe if you had positioned the girls in an area away from the grate it may have had a little more oomph overall.', '2007-08-17 01:16:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4005834, 569687, 82092, '<td valign="top">Your big fish has some beautiful colors. If they were brought out a little more your picture could have some more wow factor. Maybe not such a tight crop would help also, the fish looks kind of boxed in.</td>', 'Your big fish has some beautiful colors. If they were brought out a little more your picture could have some more wow factor. Maybe not such a tight crop would help also, the fish looks kind of boxed in.', '2007-08-17 01:21:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4005844, 569874, 82092, '<td valign="top">Awesome colors!</td>', 'Awesome colors!', '2007-08-17 01:26:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4005845, 569403, 82092, '<td valign="top">I like the movement of the individuals. The lighting on the sides of the picture is a bit distracting.</td>', 'I like the movement of the individuals. The lighting on the sides of the picture is a bit distracting.', '2007-08-17 01:28:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4005850, 569866, 82092, '<td valign="top">LOL this is a funny picture with the One Owner For Sale sign. The lines in the middle of the picture that "cut" the plane up take away from the picture. I think the picture could have benefited if some how it was taken from a different angle where those objects were not in the picture. Boosting the colors may also help this picture a bit.<br/> <br/></td>', 'LOL this is a funny picture with the One Owner For Sale sign. The lines in the middle of the picture that "cut" the plane up take away from the picture. I think the picture could have benefited if some how it was taken from a different angle where those objects were not in the picture. Boosting the colors may also help this picture a bit. ', '2007-08-17 01:33:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4005856, 570560, 82092, '<td valign="top">I like how the colors of the background and the ground this critter is standing almost match the subject''s skin tones. I wonder what this picture would be like if the whole body was in focus.</td>', 'I like how the colors of the background and the ground this critter is standing almost match the subject''s skin tones. I wonder what this picture would be like if the whole body was in focus.', '2007-08-17 01:36:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4005861, 569960, 82092, '<td valign="top">Nice feet. This picture lacks the wow factor, the items in the background take from the feet themselves :o)</td>', 'Nice feet. This picture lacks the wow factor, the items in the background take from the feet themselves :o)', '2007-08-17 01:38:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4005864, 570685, 81577, '<td valign="top">I love the landscape reflected in the window.</td>', 'I love the landscape reflected in the window.', '2007-08-17 01:40:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4005868, 570286, 82092, '<td valign="top">This flower really does look like fire. I like how the petals are heading in all different directions and the petals on the bottom are a darker color than those on the top. There is one spot in the foreground that seems blown out and is a bit distracting. It also seems like the picture needs some sharpening and/or noise reduction. Overall, awesome idea and composition.</td>', 'This flower really does look like fire. I like how the petals are heading in all different directions and the petals on the bottom are a darker color than those on the top. There is one spot in the foreground that seems blown out and is a bit distracting. It also seems like the picture needs some sharpening and/or noise reduction. Overall, awesome idea and composition.', '2007-08-17 01:42:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4005877, 569256, 82092, '<td valign="top">Oh this little one just tugs at my heart. I love the expression you have caught here. A boost in the colors would really make your subject and background pop. I can see some clouds in the sky. If there was some way to bring out some blue in the sky similar to what is in the clothing that might really add to this picture. Some noise reduction and sharpening may make this image a little clearer also.</td>', 'Oh this little one just tugs at my heart. I love the expression you have caught here. A boost in the colors would really make your subject and background pop. I can see some clouds in the sky. If there was some way to bring out some blue in the sky similar to what is in the clothing that might really add to this picture. Some noise reduction and sharpening may make this image a little clearer also.', '2007-08-17 01:48:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4005879, 570019, 82092, '<td valign="top">Nice action shot.</td>', 'Nice action shot.', '2007-08-17 01:49:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4005891, 569935, 82092, '<td valign="top">Nice portrait. I like how the background resembles the colors of some of the medals on the jacket. The print that is in focus around the head is a bit distracting, maybe a bit of blurring in that area could reduce the clarity of the print.</td>', 'Nice portrait. I like how the background resembles the colors of some of the medals on the jacket. The print that is in focus around the head is a bit distracting, maybe a bit of blurring in that area could reduce the clarity of the print.', '2007-08-17 01:53:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4006138, 570384, 22011, '<td valign="top">At the time of day you too this the contrast between the sky and dark shadow is just too great..  Possibly when the sun was further around? or at the other end of the day?</td>', 'At the time of day you too this the contrast between the sky and dark shadow is just too great..  Possibly when the sun was further around? or at the other end of the day?', '2007-08-17 07:07:05.000000', NULL, 1),
