(4011235, 570623, 9906, '<td valign="top">Love this shot.  Like the b/w treatment.  Like the pose.  Like the expression.  Love the eyes!!!  Great overall capture.  Makes me wanna go to the lake.<br/>Kudos<br/>TC</td>', 'Love this shot.  Like the b/w treatment.  Like the pose.  Like the expression.  Love the eyes!!!  Great overall capture.  Makes me wanna go to the lake.KudosTC', '2007-08-19 15:35:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4011240, 570067, 9906, '<td valign="top">Nice scene and composition.  I know that this is an early morning shot.  You can tell from the tonality of the light.  That said, your pink sky just looks odd.  Don''t know if you need to make it more or less saturated (the sky that is) but this just looks a bit funny.<br/>TC</td>', 'Nice scene and composition.  I know that this is an early morning shot.  You can tell from the tonality of the light.  That said, your pink sky just looks odd.  Don''t know if you need to make it more or less saturated (the sky that is) but this just looks a bit funny.TC', '2007-08-19 15:36:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4011246, 569973, 9906, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot of nothing.  Once in a while you can get away with this.  You did it here with the wonderful lines that seem to go all over the place but actually end up leading your eye out of the frame at the top left.  This is enough to make this shot work.<br/>TC</td>', 'This is a great shot of nothing.  Once in a while you can get away with this.  You did it here with the wonderful lines that seem to go all over the place but actually end up leading your eye out of the frame at the top left.  This is enough to make this shot work.TC', '2007-08-19 15:38:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4011254, 569960, 9906, '<td valign="top">A shot like this could actually work.  However in this instance there is just too much clutter in the background.  Look at most of the high scoring shots.  They are very simple with little or no unnecessary elements in them.  You would also have to have a different lighting scheme for this to work good.  It''s pretty obvious that you used the flash here.  Some good lighting from one side and maybe some more subtle lighting from the other side would give the important part of the shot (the feet) much more depth.<br/>TC</td>', 'A shot like this could actually work.  However in this instance there is just too much clutter in the background.  Look at most of the high scoring shots.  They are very simple with little or no unnecessary elements in them.  You would also have to have a different lighting scheme for this to work good.  It''s pretty obvious that you used the flash here.  Some good lighting from one side and maybe some more subtle lighting from the other side would give the important part of the shot (the feet) much more depth.TC', '2007-08-19 15:41:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4011261, 570456, 9906, '<td valign="top">Interesting study type of shot but your DOF is a bit too shallow (IMHO) and i can''t seem to tell exactly what IS in focus...<br/>TC</td>', 'Interesting study type of shot but your DOF is a bit too shallow (IMHO) and i can''t seem to tell exactly what IS in focus...TC', '2007-08-19 15:43:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4011265, 569981, 9906, '<td valign="top">IMHO you have just a bit too much negative space at the bottom of this shot.  I''m also confused as to what the selective desat is supposed to tell me.<br/>TC</td>', 'IMHO you have just a bit too much negative space at the bottom of this shot.  I''m also confused as to what the selective desat is supposed to tell me.TC', '2007-08-19 15:43:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4011269, 570596, 9906, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry but the only thing I can say about this is that it''s freakin'' gorgeous.<br/>TC</td>', 'I''m sorry but the only thing I can say about this is that it''s freakin'' gorgeous.TC', '2007-08-19 15:44:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4011287, 569787, 82890, '<td valign="top">Great capture! You caught some of his very essence in his eyes... love it!</td>', 'Great capture! You caught some of his very essence in his eyes... love it!', '2007-08-19 15:50:38.000000', NULL, 1),
