(4011304, 569800, 82890, '<td valign="top">This might have looked nice with some slightly blurry edges. Nice concept though, love how you caught the ruts in the pool surface...</td>', 'This might have looked nice with some slightly blurry edges. Nice concept though, love how you caught the ruts in the pool surface...', '2007-08-19 15:53:41.000000', NULL, 1),
