(4011376, 570629, 9906, '<td valign="top">Dude, I love this shot.  It''s too bad for the guy in the background, but what can ya do?  Love the expression and the pose.  Love the contrast of Tucker''s blue clothes and the bright yellow blower.  Great shot in my book!<br/>TC<br/>(Comment only since I know who ya are!)</td>', 'Dude, I love this shot.  It''s too bad for the guy in the background, but what can ya do?  Love the expression and the pose.  Love the contrast of Tucker''s blue clothes and the bright yellow blower.  Great shot in my book!TC(Comment only since I know who ya are!)', '2007-08-19 16:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4011378, 570641, 82890, '<td valign="top">Great use of shadow, though I would have added more contrast for my tastes. Would have made the shadows pop out a bit more.</td>', 'Great use of shadow, though I would have added more contrast for my tastes. Would have made the shadows pop out a bit more.', '2007-08-19 16:14:19.000000', NULL, 1),
