(4011395, 569867, 9906, '<td valign="top">Overall I really like this shot.  Could use just a touch more fill lighting on the flowers and hair.  The thing that bothers me a little is the skin tones.  I hate working with these tones because of the complexity of them.  Don''t ask me what is wrong with these tones here cause I''m not really sure.  They just don''t look ''right''...<br/>TC</td>', 'Overall I really like this shot.  Could use just a touch more fill lighting on the flowers and hair.  The thing that bothers me a little is the skin tones.  I hate working with these tones because of the complexity of them.  Don''t ask me what is wrong with these tones here cause I''m not really sure.  They just don''t look ''right''...TC', '2007-08-19 16:17:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4011397, 570526, 9906, '<td valign="top">Either your shutter speed wasn''t fast enough or your focus is just a touch off.  It would be a lot more interesting shot if the ball were involved...<br/>TC</td>', 'Either your shutter speed wasn''t fast enough or your focus is just a touch off.  It would be a lot more interesting shot if the ball were involved...TC', '2007-08-19 16:18:44.000000', NULL, 1),
