(4011566, 570496, 50695, '<td valign="top">This is a glorious photo. The drops of water seem to echo the beams of light. The title is a perfect evocation of what this photo looks like. 10</td>', 'This is a glorious photo. The drops of water seem to echo the beams of light. The title is a perfect evocation of what this photo looks like. 10', '2007-08-19 17:08:38.000000', NULL, 1),
