(4011577, 570683, 50695, '<td valign="top">For forcing an image where there was none, for creating a world that does not exist, for taking a picture of my own mind looking at a picture, I present you<br/> <br/>The Posthumous Blue Ribbon<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/bluepost.jpg"/></td>', 'For forcing an image where there was none, for creating a world that does not exist, for taking a picture of my own mind looking at a picture, I present you The Posthumous Blue Ribbon ', '2007-08-19 17:12:49.000000', NULL, 1),
