(4011618, 569767, 50695, '<td valign="top">I love the bright worlds sprouting out of their heads. This is such a happy picture. 9</td>', 'I love the bright worlds sprouting out of their heads. This is such a happy picture. 9', '2007-08-19 17:23:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4011650, 569404, 22125, '<td valign="top">Benson could do with a shave and a little nose plucking, lighting great but I can''t see the eye Bob.</td>', 'Benson could do with a shave and a little nose plucking, lighting great but I can''t see the eye Bob.', '2007-08-19 17:42:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4011657, 569330, 41337, '<td valign="top">While the light is good to show shape it''s not the defining characteristic like you would expect it to be. Usually when something is shot against a black background you immediate think studio so expectations are high for fantastic lighting. <br/> <br/>That said it may not even be your light but rather the way the subject is floating in the frame. The brighter areas against that black background makes the light feel harsher than it actually is and for still life you don''t really want that. Had there been a table or cloth that was catching some of the light I bet this would have a totally different feel to it. <br/> <br/>Mind you this isn''t a bad shot or anything just giving you my thoughts on the lighting. Good luck.</td>', 'While the light is good to show shape it''s not the defining characteristic like you would expect it to be. Usually when something is shot against a black background you immediate think studio so expectations are high for fantastic lighting.  That said it may not even be your light but rather the way the subject is floating in the frame. The brighter areas against that black background makes the light feel harsher than it actually is and for still life you don''t really want that. Had there been a table or cloth that was catching some of the light I bet this would have a totally different feel to it.  Mind you this isn''t a bad shot or anything just giving you my thoughts on the lighting. Good luck.', '2007-08-19 17:48:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4011661, 570526, 41337, '<td valign="top">I can see the ball tucked away on the other side but the way the defender''s arm comes out it makes it look like the ball carrier doesn''t have the ball at all. I know you can''t do much about the background but it would have been nice had those people were actually interested in the action on the field.</td>', 'I can see the ball tucked away on the other side but the way the defender''s arm comes out it makes it look like the ball carrier doesn''t have the ball at all. I know you can''t do much about the background but it would have been nice had those people were actually interested in the action on the field.', '2007-08-19 17:51:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4011665, 570648, 41337, '<td valign="top">Very interesting POV.</td>', 'Very interesting POV.', '2007-08-19 17:52:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4011682, 570585, 41337, '<td valign="top">I''m trying to figure out the appeal in this shot and I''m at a loss. It needs a subject. Not everything needs one but if it''s not going to have one then I think there needs to be some sort of symbotic/zen quality to it and I don''t find that here. Sorry.</td>', 'I''m trying to figure out the appeal in this shot and I''m at a loss. It needs a subject. Not everything needs one but if it''s not going to have one then I think there needs to be some sort of symbotic/zen quality to it and I don''t find that here. Sorry.', '2007-08-19 17:56:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4011690, 569329, 41337, '<td valign="top">Very nice clarity you''ve achieved here.</td>', 'Very nice clarity you''ve achieved here.', '2007-08-19 17:59:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4011716, 570388, 82890, '<td valign="top">Nice title and great coloring...</td>', 'Nice title and great coloring...', '2007-08-19 18:21:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(4011717, 569957, 82890, '<td valign="top">Powerful color contrasts there...</td>', 'Powerful color contrasts there...', '2007-08-19 18:21:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4011718, 570023, 82890, '<td valign="top">Clever title and a great capture to boot</td>', 'Clever title and a great capture to boot', '2007-08-19 18:22:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4011745, 569479, 8860, '<td valign="top">A great subject, with only rervations made for a lack of detail in the overxposed water. The light is good, but think you could have made more of it by moving across to the other bank (if there were enough interesting features). In changing the angle you would reduce the amount of light coming of the water, as it''s bouncing straight into the lens like a mirror. There would also be more texture in the rocks. Still a good shot, but I bet you could make it stunning if this was shot in RAW  if so you should perhaps have spent more time bringing in multiple ''exposures'' and overlaying them as in HDR composites.</td>', 'A great subject, with only rervations made for a lack of detail in the overxposed water. The light is good, but think you could have made more of it by moving across to the other bank (if there were enough interesting features). In changing the angle you would reduce the amount of light coming of the water, as it''s bouncing straight into the lens like a mirror. There would also be more texture in the rocks. Still a good shot, but I bet you could make it stunning if this was shot in RAW  if so you should perhaps have spent more time bringing in multiple ''exposures'' and overlaying them as in HDR composites.', '2007-08-19 18:40:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4011747, 570688, 8860, '<td valign="top">Difficult shot to pull off (into light) but you''ve done well. I''d have cloned your lens flare mind.</td>', 'Difficult shot to pull off (into light) but you''ve done well. I''d have cloned your lens flare mind.', '2007-08-19 18:42:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4011786, 569905, 8860, '<td valign="top">Good use of centering of the main subject. However, I''d rather have seen more of the interesting paving than the over processed, undramatic sky, which would have compensated for the lack of strong light. Your wide angle lens would have made the view very impactful and prevented the centred horizon.</td>', 'Good use of centering of the main subject. However, I''d rather have seen more of the interesting paving than the over processed, undramatic sky, which would have compensated for the lack of strong light. Your wide angle lens would have made the view very impactful and prevented the centred horizon.', '2007-08-19 18:58:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4011800, 570168, 8860, '<td valign="top">A very strong shot with great use of available cloud interest. This makes an ordinary scene very special  the hallmarks of a natural eye. Love the finishing touch of some rich, vivid processing thanks to an already well lit original. It''s a close call but I may have panned slightly left and placed the subject off-centre, losing the almost-but-not-quite-discernible mountainous feature.</td>', 'A very strong shot with great use of available cloud interest. This makes an ordinary scene very special  the hallmarks of a natural eye. Love the finishing touch of some rich, vivid processing thanks to an already well lit original. It''s a close call but I may have panned slightly left and placed the subject off-centre, losing the almost-but-not-quite-discernible mountainous feature.', '2007-08-19 19:03:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4011802, 570571, 8860, '<td valign="top">Great title and idea.</td>', 'Great title and idea.', '2007-08-19 19:04:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4011804, 570242, 8860, '<td valign="top">I almost missed that little fly! Great spot and beautiful clarity.</td>', 'I almost missed that little fly! Great spot and beautiful clarity.', '2007-08-19 19:04:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4011812, 570693, 8860, '<td valign="top">Excellent photo - very disorientating, nicely composed with a superb depth of subject.</td>', 'Excellent photo - very disorientating, nicely composed with a superb depth of subject.', '2007-08-19 19:07:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4011818, 570399, 8860, '<td valign="top">I hate the title (sorry!) but I love your shot. Very strong and memorable. You''ll surely do well with this kind of thing.</td>', 'I hate the title (sorry!) but I love your shot. Very strong and memorable. You''ll surely do well with this kind of thing.', '2007-08-19 19:09:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4011857, 570106, 61651, '<td valign="top">Great perspective - I seem to have an affinity for in-your-face cow shots. :)  On my monitor, the whiskers look like you are getting close to that fine line between sharpened and oversharpened.  Great job though, one of my favorites for the challenge.</td>', 'Great perspective - I seem to have an affinity for in-your-face cow shots. :)  On my monitor, the whiskers look like you are getting close to that fine line between sharpened and oversharpened.  Great job though, one of my favorites for the challenge.', '2007-08-19 19:37:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4011859, 570120, 61651, '<td valign="top">Very mysterious - what are those things in the background?   I really like the simplicity of this shot.</td>', 'Very mysterious - what are those things in the background?   I really like the simplicity of this shot.', '2007-08-19 19:38:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4011860, 570324, 61651, '<td valign="top">Great study of shapes and texture.</td>', 'Great study of shapes and texture.', '2007-08-19 19:38:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4011861, 570240, 61651, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, especially the added detail of the track marks in the sand.  Also like how the different areas are distinguishable, not just in the shapes they create, but in what tonal range exists in each area.</td>', 'Nice composition, especially the added detail of the track marks in the sand.  Also like how the different areas are distinguishable, not just in the shapes they create, but in what tonal range exists in each area.', '2007-08-19 19:41:09.000000', NULL, 1),
