(4011867, 569736, 61651, '<td valign="top">The vignette appears to be veering slightly on the overdone side of things, but still the vignette works for the toning you chose.  The composition has a nice emotive effect.</td>', 'The vignette appears to be veering slightly on the overdone side of things, but still the vignette works for the toning you chose.  The composition has a nice emotive effect.', '2007-08-19 19:45:47.000000', NULL, 1),
