(4013017, 570072, 59267, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Breeee123:</b></div><hr/><i> Wow, congrats on your red!  Looks like you got your ribbon after all.  = ) </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Thank you Briana. I thought I would miss top ten because my starting score was so low and there are so many excellent photo in this challenge. This is my first speed challenge and free study. I was so nervous.</td>', 'Originally posted by Breeee123: Wow, congrats on your red!  Looks like you got your ribbon after all.  = )  Thank you Briana. I thought I would miss top ten because my starting score was so low and there are so many excellent photo in this challenge. This is my first speed challenge and free study. I was so nervous.', '2007-08-20 02:02:38.000000', NULL, 0),
