(4013059, 570515, 71931, '<td valign="top">It is quite obvious that very few people really paid any attention to the topic.  Either that, or I completely misunderstood it, but if so, I''m not alone, as there were a few others who took the Advanced Editing Rule to heart and used it to the full extent.  The fact that just about every one of those shots which had effects work done on them got low marks can only mean that the vast majority of the voters either didn''t bother to read the Rules, or didn''t care.  Sad, really...<br/> <br/>There was one comment which had value: "A little more clarity and this could have potential."  I can see the point being made.  The effect I was going for was that of a pencil sketch of a deadbolt.  I added the grain to heighten the contrast, but I might have overdone it.<br/> <br/>I also appreciate the ''9'' that I got; at least one voter understood what I was trying to do: thanks!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-08-20 01:22:23.</i></td>', 'It is quite obvious that very few people really paid any attention to the topic.  Either that, or I completely misunderstood it, but if so, I''m not alone, as there were a few others who took the Advanced Editing Rule to heart and used it to the full extent.  The fact that just about every one of those shots which had effects work done on them got low marks can only mean that the vast majority of the voters either didn''t bother to read the Rules, or didn''t care.  Sad, really... There was one comment which had value: "A little more clarity and this could have potential."  I can see the point being made.  The effect I was going for was that of a pencil sketch of a deadbolt.  I added the grain to heighten the contrast, but I might have overdone it. I also appreciate the ''9'' that I got; at least one voter understood what I was trying to do: thanks!', '2007-08-20 02:19:18.000000', '2007-08-20 02:22:23.000000', 0),
(4013063, 570623, 16241, '<td valign="top">gorgeous.</td>', 'gorgeous.', '2007-08-20 02:23:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(4013065, 569814, 16241, '<td valign="top">stunning sandy, congrats!</td>', 'stunning sandy, congrats!', '2007-08-20 02:24:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(4013067, 569814, 20608, '<td valign="top">I KNEW THIS WOULD RIBBON!!! Congrats Sandy you SOOO deserve this after all your hard efforts. You are an inspiration in the team, we are so proud to have you... ROCK ON!!!!!<br/> <br/>Now I have to change those ribbon awards on our teams cards...hahahaha<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-08-20 01:30:23.</i></td>', 'I KNEW THIS WOULD RIBBON!!! Congrats Sandy you SOOO deserve this after all your hard efforts. You are an inspiration in the team, we are so proud to have you... ROCK ON!!!!! Now I have to change those ribbon awards on our teams cards...hahahaha', '2007-08-20 02:24:41.000000', '2007-08-20 02:30:23.000000', 0),
(4013077, 569814, 63398, '<td valign="top">Congrats on an awesome shot and terrific finish! Spectacular Expressive face!</td>', 'Congrats on an awesome shot and terrific finish! Spectacular Expressive face!', '2007-08-20 02:30:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(4013100, 570482, 78255, '<td valign="top">Ben, I wanted to get a sharp shot. I thought the fact that the jet-ski is mostly out of the water, and the spray behind, body posture of the rider etc. portrayed speed. He was going very fast.<br/>digifotojo, I can assure you I did the best I could with the background. I moved up and down the beach always paying attention to the background. It is what it is, but I appreciate your feedback.<br/>psart, thank you so much for your comment. You *got* what I was trying to accomplish here. I actually was on my belly on the edge of the water. Photo was taken at 300mm, f/10, 1/800.<br/>I want to thank each of you for leaving a comment.</td>', 'Ben, I wanted to get a sharp shot. I thought the fact that the jet-ski is mostly out of the water, and the spray behind, body posture of the rider etc. portrayed speed. He was going very fast.digifotojo, I can assure you I did the best I could with the background. I moved up and down the beach always paying attention to the background. It is what it is, but I appreciate your feedback.psart, thank you so much for your comment. You *got* what I was trying to accomplish here. I actually was on my belly on the edge of the water. Photo was taken at 300mm, f/10, 1/800.I want to thank each of you for leaving a comment.', '2007-08-20 02:36:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(4013101, 570626, 30982, '<td valign="top">I didn''t get to finish voting but this was one of my top two for the half that I did get to vote.  Lovely work.</td>', 'I didn''t get to finish voting but this was one of my top two for the half that I did get to vote.  Lovely work.', '2007-08-20 02:36:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(4013114, 570515, 34938, '<td valign="top">Hi Jim,<br/> <br/>read your comments in the forum but this image is really poor...excessive editing and special effects filters just don''t go well in dpc. When you look at the quality of the best shots taken here and then look at this, it is no wonder it scored a 3.3. I am not being mean, just stating the facts for you for the future. <br/></td>', 'Hi Jim, read your comments in the forum but this image is really poor...excessive editing and special effects filters just don''t go well in dpc. When you look at the quality of the best shots taken here and then look at this, it is no wonder it scored a 3.3. I am not being mean, just stating the facts for you for the future. ', '2007-08-20 02:41:11.000000', NULL, 0),
