(4013680, 570515, 49109, '<td valign="top">"few people paid attention to the topic"? In a Free Study" there is no topic. The Advanced editing rules say "You MAY use filters etc.", not "You should" or "You must". "using the rules to the full extent" ? That does not guarantee a good result, as we can see here. There isn''t a single trace of photography left. I didn''t vote on this because i thought it would be DQed anyway for use of special effects filters or for being literal artwork. if i had voted, it would have been a 1 (which i give out rarely), and I suspect the 9-voter was a troll.</td>', '"few people paid attention to the topic"? In a Free Study" there is no topic. The Advanced editing rules say "You MAY use filters etc.", not "You should" or "You must". "using the rules to the full extent" ? That does not guarantee a good result, as we can see here. There isn''t a single trace of photography left. I didn''t vote on this because i thought it would be DQed anyway for use of special effects filters or for being literal artwork. if i had voted, it would have been a 1 (which i give out rarely), and I suspect the 9-voter was a troll.', '2007-08-20 09:03:32.000000', NULL, 0),
