(4013922, 570107, 11769, '<td valign="top">Perfect capture, perfect motion blur. Commenter''s gave you a 8.6 so there is definitely a disparity with voters accepting any blur. Very nice.</td>', 'Perfect capture, perfect motion blur. Commenter''s gave you a 8.6 so there is definitely a disparity with voters accepting any blur. Very nice.', '2007-08-20 10:14:07.000000', NULL, 0),
