(4014022, 569922, 75162, '<td valign="top">This one was my first challenge! I guess i expected a better result, but hey I still need to know more about the generaly admitted style here :)<br/>thanks all for your comments<br/> <br/>this pic was shot from a moving bus, in the north of Paris. This city is 99% of my inspiration!<br/>I got many other takes like this one, but it''s my prefered, due to the 2 girls, and ... yes : the exploded composition ;)<br/> <br/>I''m also glad to achieve such an esthetic blur with a numeric medium</td>', 'This one was my first challenge! I guess i expected a better result, but hey I still need to know more about the generaly admitted style here :)thanks all for your comments this pic was shot from a moving bus, in the north of Paris. This city is 99% of my inspiration!I got many other takes like this one, but it''s my prefered, due to the 2 girls, and ... yes : the exploded composition ;) I''m also glad to achieve such an esthetic blur with a numeric medium', '2007-08-20 10:36:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(4014026, 570051, 60581, '<td valign="top">as usual, nice shot!!! you are expert with this..now you have to teach us (at-least me) how you did this or do these kind of shots? :)</td>', 'as usual, nice shot!!! you are expert with this..now you have to teach us (at-least me) how you did this or do these kind of shots? :)', '2007-08-20 10:37:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(4014033, 570072, 60581, '<td valign="top">I am seeing another ribbon coming on the way!!! great shot!!!</td>', 'I am seeing another ribbon coming on the way!!! great shot!!!', '2007-08-20 10:39:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(4014083, 569814, 66597, '<td valign="top">Woo hoo, Sandy! I didn''t get to this while voting, but you would have had one more 10 if I had. What an incredible image! The lines in her face are amazing, as is the smoke and how it frames her face.</td>', 'Woo hoo, Sandy! I didn''t get to this while voting, but you would have had one more 10 if I had. What an incredible image! The lines in her face are amazing, as is the smoke and how it frames her face.', '2007-08-20 11:00:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(4014096, 569923, 66597, '<td valign="top">Deb - this is great! I didn''t know you entered this challenge. Congrats on such a beautiful image and strong finish!</td>', 'Deb - this is great! I didn''t know you entered this challenge. Congrats on such a beautiful image and strong finish!', '2007-08-20 11:03:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(4014108, 569814, 66384, '<td valign="top">Sandy, this is an awesome photo. Congratulations on your ribbon. I like your story too -- the fact that she used to be a model. You can see that she has great bone structure in her face. I am going to send this to my daughter who smokes. A little more fuel for the anti-smoking fire. I have seen other examples of how smoking affects the skin, and this is one of the best.</td>', 'Sandy, this is an awesome photo. Congratulations on your ribbon. I like your story too -- the fact that she used to be a model. You can see that she has great bone structure in her face. I am going to send this to my daughter who smokes. A little more fuel for the anti-smoking fire. I have seen other examples of how smoking affects the skin, and this is one of the best.', '2007-08-20 11:07:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(4014121, 570051, 66597, '<td valign="top">Congrats - this one may be your best splash photo yet! How about a tutorial on this amazing effect?</td>', 'Congrats - this one may be your best splash photo yet! How about a tutorial on this amazing effect?', '2007-08-20 11:15:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(4014123, 569814, 42256, '<td valign="top">This is an amazing shot and story - i love these type of shots, shots where the photographer does beyond being just a photographer!! Congrats on the ribbon! <br/></td>', 'This is an amazing shot and story - i love these type of shots, shots where the photographer does beyond being just a photographer!! Congrats on the ribbon! ', '2007-08-20 11:16:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(4014137, 570054, 66384, '<td valign="top">This looks like a bad hit n'' run. Very interesting though. The costume is very colorful.</td>', 'This looks like a bad hit n'' run. Very interesting though. The costume is very colorful.', '2007-08-20 11:25:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(4014144, 570285, 66384, '<td valign="top">Rob, you caught this nicely. Really nice DOF and focus. Too bad it is all tattered. I think you could boost the light on the wing to give it a bit more life.</td>', 'Rob, you caught this nicely. Really nice DOF and focus. Too bad it is all tattered. I think you could boost the light on the wing to give it a bit more life.', '2007-08-20 11:29:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(4014155, 570051, 17513, '<td valign="top">fantastic shot...well done/congrats</td>', 'fantastic shot...well done/congrats', '2007-08-20 11:33:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(4014156, 570072, 17513, '<td valign="top">wonderful shot well done/congrats</td>', 'wonderful shot well done/congrats', '2007-08-20 11:34:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(4014158, 569814, 17513, '<td valign="top">congratulations,great shot.</td>', 'congratulations,great shot.', '2007-08-20 11:35:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(4014190, 570195, 38032, '<td valign="top">I''ve wanted to do this sorta thing but never got around to it.  This is great!</td>', 'I''ve wanted to do this sorta thing but never got around to it.  This is great!', '2007-08-20 11:54:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(4014211, 569814, 62637, '<td valign="top">Awesome score sandy!  Congrats on the new PB, how could someone give this a 1??( or a 3, or 4...)<br/> <br/>I still cant believe you do your street stuff with that big 70-200 though; I could never work up the courage to go wave one of those around in public :-P.  Tiny primes all the way for me...</td>', 'Awesome score sandy!  Congrats on the new PB, how could someone give this a 1??( or a 3, or 4...) I still cant believe you do your street stuff with that big 70-200 though; I could never work up the courage to go wave one of those around in public :-P.  Tiny primes all the way for me...', '2007-08-20 12:02:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(4014218, 570366, 44877, '<td valign="top">Roz, I am stunned by your talent and artistry. This shot is so outstanding  in all ways. You took what was probably a snap and made it into this fantastic piece of art. Wow wow wow. <br/> <br/>The score is nice, but in no way reflects the excellent of this image. And I''d like to know what kind of hare brained idiots would have give you ones, twos and threes -  fours for that matter. Jesus. You''ve got to make this into a print.</td>', 'Roz, I am stunned by your talent and artistry. This shot is so outstanding  in all ways. You took what was probably a snap and made it into this fantastic piece of art. Wow wow wow.  The score is nice, but in no way reflects the excellent of this image. And I''d like to know what kind of hare brained idiots would have give you ones, twos and threes -  fours for that matter. Jesus. You''ve got to make this into a print.', '2007-08-20 12:04:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(4014229, 569814, 68256, '<td valign="top">Wow Sandy, that is just amazing!  Congrats on the ribbon, and new PB.</td>', 'Wow Sandy, that is just amazing!  Congrats on the ribbon, and new PB.', '2007-08-20 12:13:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(4014324, 570051, 42100, '<td valign="top">Another great liquid drop photo Irene...congratulations on winning the blue ribbon!</td>', 'Another great liquid drop photo Irene...congratulations on winning the blue ribbon!', '2007-08-20 12:37:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(4014329, 569814, 41746, '<td valign="top">You rock, Sandy. Fantastic portrait and interesting woman I say. You captured her so well. Congrats on your ribbon and PB!</td>', 'You rock, Sandy. Fantastic portrait and interesting woman I say. You captured her so well. Congrats on your ribbon and PB!', '2007-08-20 12:39:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(4014333, 570072, 42100, '<td valign="top">A stunning photograph to say the least...congratulations on a well earned red ribbon!</td>', 'A stunning photograph to say the least...congratulations on a well earned red ribbon!', '2007-08-20 12:40:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(4014339, 570629, 23484, '<td valign="top">Neat shot Geno. I like the way the highlites play off her hair. The colors work well.</td>', 'Neat shot Geno. I like the way the highlites play off her hair. The colors work well.', '2007-08-20 12:41:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(4014349, 569814, 42100, '<td valign="top">This is definitely one of the top story-telling portraits on this site, in fact I can only think of one other even in a league with this one!  Congratulations on winning the yellow ribbon!<br/> <br/>Hey, aren''t you suppose to be at RMNP...and not here ribbon hogging! ;-P</td>', 'This is definitely one of the top story-telling portraits on this site, in fact I can only think of one other even in a league with this one!  Congratulations on winning the yellow ribbon! Hey, aren''t you suppose to be at RMNP...and not here ribbon hogging! ;-P', '2007-08-20 12:44:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(4014352, 569805, 23484, '<td valign="top">Nice shot Julianne.  I see you''re back in Florida. Make sure you stop by again next time you''re on your way up.</td>', 'Nice shot Julianne.  I see you''re back in Florida. Make sure you stop by again next time you''re on your way up.', '2007-08-20 12:45:15.000000', NULL, 0),
