(4014371, 569923, 66193, '<td valign="top">Deb,  great image!  I like the textures and lines in this one.  I think the Critical Mass Logo should be a staircase from now on!</td>', 'Deb,  great image!  I like the textures and lines in this one.  I think the Critical Mass Logo should be a staircase from now on!', '2007-08-20 12:51:31.000000', NULL, 0),
