(4014380, 569923, 23484, '<td valign="top">Great job Deb. It doesn''t matter where you go, you always end up with nice images. Nice score too.</td>', 'Great job Deb. It doesn''t matter where you go, you always end up with nice images. Nice score too.', '2007-08-20 12:54:51.000000', NULL, 0),
