(4014402, 570701, 42100, '<td valign="top">I''m going to have to stop voting, almost all my tens ended up with 5.4''s.  Take away the nose ring and this reminds me very much of some vintage ad campaign photographs.  Very nice!<br/> <br/></td>', 'I''m going to have to stop voting, almost all my tens ended up with 5.4''s.  Take away the nose ring and this reminds me very much of some vintage ad campaign photographs.  Very nice! ', '2007-08-20 13:01:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(4014403, 569814, 64568, '<td valign="top">This is one of the best portraitures I''ve seen Sandy, amazing. Such power in this lady, just wonderful. and well done on your ribbon, so much deserved ;-)</td>', 'This is one of the best portraitures I''ve seen Sandy, amazing. Such power in this lady, just wonderful. and well done on your ribbon, so much deserved ;-)', '2007-08-20 13:01:42.000000', NULL, 0),
