(4015622, 570421, 11854, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by quiet_observation:</b></div><hr/><i> Great ominous looking clouds and reflection.<br/> <br/><a href="//www.nbc10.com/news/13929877/detail.html?dl=headlineclick" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Palmyra Nature Grove news</a> </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I know! They are so going to ruin this place! They did this to Delanco Island some years ago, completely filled in two huge lakes. It still stinks back there and all the wildlife either died or left.</td>', 'Originally posted by quiet_observation: Great ominous looking clouds and reflection. Palmyra Nature Grove news   I know! They are so going to ruin this place! They did this to Delanco Island some years ago, completely filled in two huge lakes. It still stinks back there and all the wildlife either died or left.', '2007-08-20 20:43:43.000000', NULL, 0),
