(4015706, 570051, 32786, '<td valign="top">Don''t get me wrong this is a awesome shot. It is crisp, the colors are amazing in short it is a really good shot. but how many times can you win a ribbon with the same shot? Are people that amazed by the same thing that its a surefire thing? Have you tried other things like sand hitting glass, water from a water gun, or anything else&gt;? You have  a great talent for these macro stop motions I personally would like to see some diffrent things. Don''t get trapped doing the same thing over and over because its a automatic good score...Just some thoughts......congrats on the ribbon</td>', 'Don''t get me wrong this is a awesome shot. It is crisp, the colors are amazing in short it is a really good shot. but how many times can you win a ribbon with the same shot? Are people that amazed by the same thing that its a surefire thing? Have you tried other things like sand hitting glass, water from a water gun, or anything else>? You have  a great talent for these macro stop motions I personally would like to see some diffrent things. Don''t get trapped doing the same thing over and over because its a automatic good score...Just some thoughts......congrats on the ribbon', '2007-08-20 21:19:26.000000', NULL, 0),
