(4016589, 570112, 30982, '<td valign="top">I love the mist - really gives this a nice touch.  It''s almost as though the history is IN the mist, and it''s a gentle reminder of what came before that appears for those who will look.</td>', 'I love the mist - really gives this a nice touch.  It''s almost as though the history is IN the mist, and it''s a gentle reminder of what came before that appears for those who will look.', '2007-08-21 04:43:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(4016591, 569707, 30982, '<td valign="top">I quite like the composition of this - a nice change from the usual full face view - excellent color and clarity.  My favorite bits are the bits of green reaching out.  I''m a wee bit befuddled by the score - I''d have expected it to do better.</td>', 'I quite like the composition of this - a nice change from the usual full face view - excellent color and clarity.  My favorite bits are the bits of green reaching out.  I''m a wee bit befuddled by the score - I''d have expected it to do better.', '2007-08-21 04:47:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(4016593, 570285, 30982, '<td valign="top">I quite like that it''s tattered - I gave this a 7 by the way.  Butterflies have such very short lives to begin with and are so very fragile that I like it when they''re captured (photographically) near the end of their existance, showing the wear and tear they take over that very short period of time.  Color, composition are good and I like the DOF you used.</td>', 'I quite like that it''s tattered - I gave this a 7 by the way.  Butterflies have such very short lives to begin with and are so very fragile that I like it when they''re captured (photographically) near the end of their existance, showing the wear and tear they take over that very short period of time.  Color, composition are good and I like the DOF you used.', '2007-08-21 04:51:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(4016595, 570421, 30982, '<td valign="top">What a gorgeous sky!  I like the unusual approach of using an industrial skyline instead of a natural one - just goes to show that sunsets can be wonderful no matter where you are.  Hopefully they''ll leave this lake (didn''t read the link, but I suspect that they''re thinking of removing it!)</td>', 'What a gorgeous sky!  I like the unusual approach of using an industrial skyline instead of a natural one - just goes to show that sunsets can be wonderful no matter where you are.  Hopefully they''ll leave this lake (didn''t read the link, but I suspect that they''re thinking of removing it!)', '2007-08-21 04:54:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(4016597, 570446, 30982, '<td valign="top">The first thing I thought of when I opened this, before reading your description, was that it was a car being used in a funeral procession for a veteran.  It evokes that kind of feeling.  I quite like the way the flags reflect in the chrome, too.  I''ve got a thing for chrome.</td>', 'The first thing I thought of when I opened this, before reading your description, was that it was a car being used in a funeral procession for a veteran.  It evokes that kind of feeling.  I quite like the way the flags reflect in the chrome, too.  I''ve got a thing for chrome.', '2007-08-21 04:56:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(4016598, 570685, 30982, '<td valign="top">And I still like the reflected day in the window.  :-)  Nice find well captured.</td>', 'And I still like the reflected day in the window.  :-)  Nice find well captured.', '2007-08-21 04:57:57.000000', NULL, 0),
(4016603, 570494, 30982, '<td valign="top">Congrats on a new top 5 AND in B&amp;W, and hey, set your preferences to show 7 across and it''ll stay on your top row a little longer!  Looks rather California-ish to me - I''d have not known otherwise other than you live in Pennsylvania.  She looks quite elegant indeed, even in her declining state, and B&amp;W definitely suits this well.  Great angle for the shot - it''s what really makes it work in my opinion.</td>', 'Congrats on a new top 5 AND in B&W, and hey, set your preferences to show 7 across and it''ll stay on your top row a little longer!  Looks rather California-ish to me - I''d have not known otherwise other than you live in Pennsylvania.  She looks quite elegant indeed, even in her declining state, and B&W definitely suits this well.  Great angle for the shot - it''s what really makes it work in my opinion.', '2007-08-21 05:18:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(4016605, 569966, 30982, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the new camera!  (I''m quite partial to that one myself.)  Lovely color in this and I *like* the softness.  May be just a bit plain for DPC voters, but it''s a pleasing representation to my eye.</td>', 'Congrats on the new camera!  (I''m quite partial to that one myself.)  Lovely color in this and I *like* the softness.  May be just a bit plain for DPC voters, but it''s a pleasing representation to my eye.', '2007-08-21 05:21:08.000000', NULL, 0),
