(4017225, 570530, 30982, '<td valign="top">No comments?  There''s a ribbon for that, you know.  Check my portfolio page and feel free to borrow the gif!<br/> <br/>This is a very good (and creepy!) closeup of a spider.  I like the "face" that appears on her (most likely a her) thorax - it''s a very kind and benevolent face on a critter that gives most people the heebie jeebies.</td>', 'No comments?  There''s a ribbon for that, you know.  Check my portfolio page and feel free to borrow the gif! This is a very good (and creepy!) closeup of a spider.  I like the "face" that appears on her (most likely a her) thorax - it''s a very kind and benevolent face on a critter that gives most people the heebie jeebies.', '2007-08-21 13:06:54.000000', NULL, 0),
