(4027411, 570482, 78303, '<td valign="top">LaRee, very nice capture.  Others mention the colors, the shutterspeed and the background.  You cannot control the background all the time.  It looks fine, but maybe cropping a wee bit off the top would make it better.<br/> <br/>I can tell there is speed involved due to the spray of the water from behind the ski.  I am amazed people actually voted this low (2 and 3).<br/> <br/>Very good.</td>', 'LaRee, very nice capture.  Others mention the colors, the shutterspeed and the background.  You cannot control the background all the time.  It looks fine, but maybe cropping a wee bit off the top would make it better. I can tell there is speed involved due to the spray of the water from behind the ski.  I am amazed people actually voted this low (2 and 3). Very good.', '2007-08-24 23:56:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(4027562, 570072, 62925, '<td valign="top">They are both nice photos, very nice actually. But I just feel like you didn''t really work hard enough for both of them. Like you did for one but not the other.<br/>But in the end you have 2 beautiful photos of a beautiful place that thousands will view within days being on the front page of dpc.<br/>Congrats!</td>', 'They are both nice photos, very nice actually. But I just feel like you didn''t really work hard enough for both of them. Like you did for one but not the other.But in the end you have 2 beautiful photos of a beautiful place that thousands will view within days being on the front page of dpc.Congrats!', '2007-08-25 02:03:15.000000', NULL, 0),
