(4032132, 570413, 67145, '<td valign="top">another miserable score ... and another photograph that i really love .. it reminds me of a lot of things this photograph .. for starters it has a sort''v story book feel .. i can just imagine hansel and gretel skipping over this little bridge/path .. and the cottage i can see peeking thru the corn/weeds/foliage is like the gingerbread house .. is that the same fairy tale??   .. wotever  .. then there''s the memories i have from my childhood .. and there are overgrown, rural places in thoses memories .. love your processing and the dark, just about sombre, altho atmospheric feel .. :)</td>', 'another miserable score ... and another photograph that i really love .. it reminds me of a lot of things this photograph .. for starters it has a sort''v story book feel .. i can just imagine hansel and gretel skipping over this little bridge/path .. and the cottage i can see peeking thru the corn/weeds/foliage is like the gingerbread house .. is that the same fairy tale??   .. wotever  .. then there''s the memories i have from my childhood .. and there are overgrown, rural places in thoses memories .. love your processing and the dark, just about sombre, altho atmospheric feel .. :)', '2007-08-27 09:05:19.000000', NULL, 0),
