(4077173, 569898, 50034, '<td valign="top"><b>Wow!  You ARE a lovely lady!</b>  You ARE an amazing beauty in the buff, especially being part of my same decade.  May the LORD give you beauty well into your "sunset years."<br/> <br/>I suspect your beauty is as much from a pleasant heart as consistent exercise!  <b>Congratulations, MS. Judi!</b><br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-09-10 06:26:17.</i></td>', 'Wow!  You ARE a lovely lady!  You ARE an amazing beauty in the buff, especially being part of my same decade.  May the LORD give you beauty well into your "sunset years." I suspect your beauty is as much from a pleasant heart as consistent exercise!  Congratulations, MS. Judi!', '2007-09-10 07:25:10.000000', '2007-09-10 07:26:17.000000', 0),
(4081091, 570081, 67697, '<td valign="top">I love the colors of this.  The greens and yellows are such nice complements to each other.  The bokeh is indeed beautiful!</td>', 'I love the colors of this.  The greens and yellows are such nice complements to each other.  The bokeh is indeed beautiful!', '2007-09-11 13:26:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(4081160, 569885, 40718, '<td valign="top">Technicals: you did an excellent job with the contre-jour.  That takes skill and you handled it well.  I like the gradient the sky provides.  Sillouettes are also nicely black.  I do not like partially sillouetted subjects.<br/> <br/>The feel: The biggest issue with the picuture is probably the jumbled appearance of the objects.  They do not flow nicely which makes the overall shot less appealing.  If it were the two silos and the central pole only, I think it would look nice with the symmetry, but this is ruined by the building behind and the support on the left.<br/> <br/>The game:  The 5-score rewarded the sky, the ground kept it from being a 6.</td>', 'Technicals: you did an excellent job with the contre-jour.  That takes skill and you handled it well.  I like the gradient the sky provides.  Sillouettes are also nicely black.  I do not like partially sillouetted subjects. The feel: The biggest issue with the picuture is probably the jumbled appearance of the objects.  They do not flow nicely which makes the overall shot less appealing.  If it were the two silos and the central pole only, I think it would look nice with the symmetry, but this is ruined by the building behind and the support on the left. The game:  The 5-score rewarded the sky, the ground kept it from being a 6.', '2007-09-11 13:45:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(4082072, 569895, 40718, '<td valign="top">Technicals:  The lighting is nice.  The focus appears to be on.  You will notice that you had to choose between a level horizon and vertical buildings.  You went buildings, which is probably the right answer.  Sometimes perspective correction can let you do both.<br/> <br/>The feel: The clouds add appeal in the background.  I think the shot feels cramped.  I don''t know what is to the left and right there in Perth, but I think I want to let those buildings breathe.<br/> <br/>The game: Not bad.  If anything, I would have tried to spot a time with even more dramatic light.  It''s certainly not bad here, but I''m sure you could squeeze a little more "wow" out of this shot.</td>', 'Technicals:  The lighting is nice.  The focus appears to be on.  You will notice that you had to choose between a level horizon and vertical buildings.  You went buildings, which is probably the right answer.  Sometimes perspective correction can let you do both. The feel: The clouds add appeal in the background.  I think the shot feels cramped.  I don''t know what is to the left and right there in Perth, but I think I want to let those buildings breathe. The game: Not bad.  If anything, I would have tried to spot a time with even more dramatic light.  It''s certainly not bad here, but I''m sure you could squeeze a little more "wow" out of this shot.', '2007-09-11 19:59:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(4084773, 570634, 65319, '<td valign="top">Such a lovely photo...I want one this good in my own portfolio!!!  (But, truly, I think the fog would look so much better...PURPLE!!!...hehehe)</td>', 'Such a lovely photo...I want one this good in my own portfolio!!!  (But, truly, I think the fog would look so much better...PURPLE!!!...hehehe)', '2007-09-12 14:28:34.000000', NULL, 0),
