(5177203, 569814, 88204, '<td valign="top">Your Portrait of the Elderly ribbon got me back into your portfolio... and found this outstanding shot. Fabulous composition, expression, smoke, post processing and a great story to go with it. Please... keep these street portraits coming... they''re wonderful! You really have a knack for connecting with your subjects!</td>', 'Your Portrait of the Elderly ribbon got me back into your portfolio... and found this outstanding shot. Fabulous composition, expression, smoke, post processing and a great story to go with it. Please... keep these street portraits coming... they''re wonderful! You really have a knack for connecting with your subjects!', '2009-01-07 06:58:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(5194706, 569814, 101798, '<td valign="top">It''s amazing how different compositions of the same subject changes the mood of the photograph. The hand deflecting the smoke just makes it.</td>', 'It''s amazing how different compositions of the same subject changes the mood of the photograph. The hand deflecting the smoke just makes it.', '2009-01-16 08:24:30.000000', NULL, 0),
