(5771954, 570051, 82814, '<td valign="top">Absolutely brilliant - I''m inspired!!!  Well done.  Cheers, S.</td>', 'Absolutely brilliant - I''m inspired!!!  Well done.  Cheers, S.', '2009-12-19 04:05:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(5921851, 570051, 103048, '<td valign="top">Oh wow, awesome! I spent 4 evenings trying to get something like this, but failed...how do you get this umbrella shape? I''m guessing that''s some sort of a home-made / improvised tap, that drips the drops (lol!) at a rate such that when one drop hits the water and bounces, the second drop hits the bounced first drop? (err..if that makes sense)...<br/> <br/>Needless to say I''ve been on a quest for about a month to reproduce something like this....</td>', 'Oh wow, awesome! I spent 4 evenings trying to get something like this, but failed...how do you get this umbrella shape? I''m guessing that''s some sort of a home-made / improvised tap, that drips the drops (lol!) at a rate such that when one drop hits the water and bounces, the second drop hits the bounced first drop? (err..if that makes sense)... Needless to say I''ve been on a quest for about a month to reproduce something like this....', '2010-03-29 21:35:41.000000', NULL, 0),
